Proof. intros T1 T2 T3 T4 P [y1 H]. destruct (to_sigX3 T2 T3 T4 (P y1) H) as [y2 y3 y4 H2]. exact (mkSigX4 T1 T2 T3 T4 P y1 y2 y3 y4 H2). Qed.
